CHAOS METRICS COMPUTED
----------------------
Particle-level:
- λ_total (global FTLE per particle)
- ln(δ/δ0) evolution curves
- λ vs initial radius r0
- λ vs final radius rf

System-level:
- Chaos fraction f(t) = fraction(λ > threshold)
- Mean FTLE ⟨λ⟩(t)
- Radial-bin FTLE evolution ⟨λ⟩(r0, t)

Phase-space structure:
- (r, v_r) scatter coloured by λ
- Stochastic layer identification

Spatial chaos field:
- 2D FTLE maps via deformation gradient tensor:
    F ≈ ∂x(t)/∂x(0)
- λ_FTLE = (1/t) ln(σ_max(F))
- Reveals Lagrangian Coherent Structures (LCS)

